	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Habeo querelas vestras<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Der Brief, auf den <persName ref="p4079">Zwick</persName> antwortet, ist nicht erhalten, vgl. aber den inhaltlich wohl ungefähr übereinstimmenden Bericht an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName>, oben <ref target="file11137">Nr. 1094</ref>, 28-44.</note>, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> charissime, quibus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>utinam Iesus Christus noster aliquando finem faciat.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>O nos miseros, quantum temporis perdimus istis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>concertationibus et verborum quęstionibus!</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Contra <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vero <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> se totos diris devovent, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ex verbo domini agant, quicquid agunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Hoc cum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>aliis multis persuasum esse non potest, quid reliquum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>est, quam ut dominus sese interponat?</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quo medio, ipse <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>novit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed nunc audio <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> respondisse <placeName ref="l862">Helvetic<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>is</placeName> ecclesiis<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Siehe oben <ref target="file11139">Nr. 1096</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> idque non solum amice, sed quod ad concordiam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>satis esse possit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quae res animum quidem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>restitueret, si modo non semper novę litigandi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>occasiones quęrerentur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p5741">Ioachimus</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p5741">Joachim Maler</persName>.</note> noster syndicus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nuper multa cum <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensibus</placeName> contulit<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p5741">Maler</persName> war mit einem Gutachten nach <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> entsandt worden, nachdem das Kammergericht in einem Prozeß zwischen Graf <persName ref="p18576">Philipp von Hanau</persName> und <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> gegen letzteres entschieden hatte; vgl. die diesbezüglichen Akten im Stadtarchiv <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName>, Ref. A. Fasc. 35, Teil 2. Zum Prozeß s. Robert <hi>Schelp,</hi> Die Reformationsprozesse der Stadt Straßburg am Reichskammergericht zur Zeit des Schmalkaldischen Bundes (1524)/1531-1541/(1555), erweiterte Ausg., Kaiserslautern 1965, S. 223-227.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>summa conatuum omnium haec est: Primo, ut <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>concordia inter ministros omnes constituatur et <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>firmetur, deinde, ista firmata, ecclesiarum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>omnium facies in ordinem quendam redigatur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Communionem enim nullam atque hinc disciplinam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nullam esse vociferantur perpetuo.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nunc vero <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nemo est, cui probetur ecclesia inanis communione <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et disciplina; tantum pugnatur contra communionis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ineundae et instituendae disciplinae rationes.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Eas <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>doceat nos Christus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Mihi persuasum non est <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ex verborum quaestionibus concordiam<pb type="edition" next="45"/> veram nasci <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>posse, et deus testabitur in istis<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>auf</hi> istis <hi>folgt gestrichenes</hi> vera[?]; <hi>an dessen Stelle am Rande nachgetragen:</hi> ex istis.</note> constare <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>non posse.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Disciplinam ecclesiasticam ex conspiratione <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>moliuntur, quae tamen apud me non nisi <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ex ipsissimo verbo dei nasci potest.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">An non et commun<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>io fuit inter fratres hactenus<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">inter fratres hactenus <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> et disciplina in ecclesia?</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Videamus, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ne novis quibusdam inventionibus communionem <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>et disciplinam sanctis rationibus iam dudum natam <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>explodamus nobisque accidat, quod cani apud<pb type="scan" next="99v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p19884">Aesopum</persName> umbram sectanti<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Der Hund, der nach dem Schatten schnappt. verliert sein Fleischstück; s. <persName ref="p19884">Aesop</persName>, Fabulae, 136 (Corpus fabularum Aesopicarum, vol. I, ed. Augustus Hausrath, Leipzig 1957, Fasc. 1, S. 161f).</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Hanc meam mentem <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>cum olfaciat <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName>, conatur me nescio quo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vocare colloquii causa<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p4334">Margaretha Blarer</persName> vom 12. Januar (<bibl source="b51">Blarer BW</bibl> II 833, Nr. 79).</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Parebo illi, nisi impedia[t]<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Hier und weiter unten Randtext beschnitten.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesia, et quanquam ille satis argutus sit et, ut <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ita dicam, invincibilis, tamen utar mea simplici[ta]<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>te et conscientia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Habes tu hic literas a <lb xml:id="p2z7"/><persName ref="p5565">Capitone</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Oben <ref target="file11135">Nr. 1092</ref>.</note>; in quibus si quid est, quod sine piac[ulo] com<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>municare queas, obsecro, ne graveris ad me dare saltem argumentum<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">ad me ... argumentum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Cu<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>pio enim ex variis et multis mentem optimorum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>virorum colligere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Scripsisti vero nuper con<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>sultare vos, quid agatis, an publicis scriptis <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>exponatis omnibus ecclesiis, quid vobiscum act[um] <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>sit<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Von diesen Überlegungen ist sonst nichts bekannt.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Eam vero consultationem non probamus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Continete vos, obsecro, praecipue cum audiamus <lb xml:id="p2z15"/><persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> aequissimas literas ad vos scripsisse.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Sinite aliis novę controversiae exordium.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Scripsistis vos <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName> vestramque misistis confession[em]<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Gemeint ist der Brief der reformierten Städte der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName> vom 12. Januar 1537 bzw. das Erste <placeName ref="l862">Helvetische</placeName> Bekenntnis; vgl. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10953">[Nr. 911]</ref>, S. 465, Anm. 1.</note>; <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>ille nunc respondet amice et confessionem probat.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Quid reliquum est, nisi ut dissimuletis omnes con<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>troversiae causas et, si quid amplius cum <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>agendum, hoc ipsum agatis amicissime et <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>uno animo.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Tantum fugite concisionem inter vo[s] <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>ipsos, cumque audiatis et <placeName ref="l28">Basilienses</placeName> et <placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>non solum non abhorrere, sed amare quoque <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensium</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>(sive concordiae, quod aiunt) studia, vestrum est velut surda aure <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>praeterire ea omnia, quae non aperte mala sunt, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>nec tam <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensium</placeName> quam <placeName ref="l862">Helveticarum</placeName> ecclesiar[um] <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>concordia<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>vor</hi> concordia <hi>ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note> observanda vobis.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Hoc fiet, si <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>unanimiter et tanquam unus vir semper ad <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>interrogata respondeatis idque ex ore domini.<pb type="edition" next="46"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>mi frater, cum <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p1753">Leone</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z32"/>Invocate vero dominum altissimis suspiriis, ut<pb type="scan" next="100r."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>a contentiosis omnibus tandem possimus quiescere <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>et nos ad ea convertere, quae simplicia sunt et ad <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>gloriam evangelii certam et solidam faciunt.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p3z4"/>Valete in Christo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l257">Constantiae</placeName>, ultima ianuarii 1538.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Ve<lb xml:id="p3z5"/>ster <persName ref="p4079">Io. Zvick</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p3z6"/>Salutant vos symmystae omnes diligentissime, <lb xml:id="p3z7"/><persName ref="p8178">consul</persName> quoque noster<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p4082">Cuͦnradus</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p4082">Konrad Zwick</persName>.</note> frater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>sancto, suo in domino <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
